Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:32:17 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Restore backend import and automate weekly forward P/E from
 FactSet

- indicators.py: restore SECTION_LABELS, CATEGORY_*, VALUATION_BANDS and the
  classify_*/format_value helpers that commit fe92aaf removed (every backend
  module failed to import, so the daily refresh could not run). Drop the
  unscored sector-ETF placeholder block that fe92aaf added: those ids are not
  in weights.json, which fails config validation at startup.
- Add scripts/fetch_forward_pe.py: reads FactSet's weekly Earnings Insight
  report and appends date,value,release_date rows to data/forward_pe.csv.
- refresh.yml: fetch step (continue-on-error), optional forward_pe_since
  backfill input, file:// default for FORWARD_PE_CSV_URL (a secret still
  overrides it), and commit data/forward_pe.csv with the snapshots.
- Describe forward P/E honestly (weekly, FactSet, PDF-parsed) in the
  indicator definition, source list, pipeline labels and README.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
